T_INDEX4LSB\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_INDEX1LSB\00glVertexAttribDivisorARB\00glDrawArraysInstancedARB\00glDrawElementsInstancedARB\00Could not read DB\00A\00???\00MultiStream<WebSocket>\00MOVE RIGHT ->\00You were destroyed by:\00platform:\00You will respawn at level %d with:\000123456789\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_INDEX8\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGR888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGRX8888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGBX8888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ABGR8888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ARGB8888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGRA8888\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGBA8888\00Build Jul  9 2022 14:26:48\00C.UTF-8\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGR565\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB565\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGR555\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB555\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ABGR1555\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ARGB1555\00Extra petal slot at level 45\00Extra petal slot at level 15\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB444\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ABGR4444\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ARGB4444\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGRA4444\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGBA4444\0057060ca147a0d2cfa0f4a4fefaa4172fa9a1b044\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGR24\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB24\00:443\00opengles2\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_YUY2\00X2\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGB332\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_YV12\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_NV12\00Y1\00X1\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_BGRA5551\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_RGBA5551\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_NV21\00Extra petal slot at level 30\00February 21st 2020\00February 1st 2020\00October 29th 2020\00February 19th 2020\00February 9th 2020\00October 28th 2020\00February 18th 2020\00February 8th 2020\00February 27th 2020\00October 27th 2020\00February 17th 2020\00February 7th 2020\00February 16th 2020\00May 16th 2020\00February 6th 2020\00February 25th 2020\00October 25th 2020\00February 15th 2020\00May 15th 2020\00March 5th 2020\00February 24th 2020\00September 24th 2020\00February 14th 2020\00May 14th 2020\00March 4th 2020\00February 13th 2020\00February 11th 2020\00February 20th 2020\00February 10th 2020\00February 23rd 2020\00February 3rd 2020\00March 3rd 2020\00November 2nd 2020\00SDL_PIXELFORMAT_ARGB2101010\00Texture dimensions can't be 0\00https://api.n.m28.io/endpoint/\00https://api.n.m28.io/server/\00/findEach/\00ws://\00wss://\00Legendary petals are now easier to find.\0aSquare has been moved to a separate category.\00Added mob gallery. No pictures at the moment, but maybe eventually.\00Spooky.\00It seems there aren't enough players to support the game mode. We've switched back to FFA now.\00You must have done something really bad if she's chasing you.\00Someone overfed this one, you might be next.\00You can now press X to swap your loadout.\00Buffed Epic Peas a little bit.\00We'll be trying out a new game mode for a couple of days: Battle Royale.\0aThere aren't enough players to split among two game modes, so this will be the only game mode available for a little bit.\00Honey now also slows down movement speed a little bit.\00It stings. Don't touch it.\00Ants go in, and come out. Can't explain that.\00We'll be playing Battle Royale again for the next couple of days.\00New petal announcements will no longer include their names, to make it a bit more mysterious.\00Avoid touching it, it hurts.\00Mob gallery improvements.\00Added Ants.\00The game mode will be polished a bit better later, for now it's a bit of a work in progress.\00Shiny, cute and mostly harmless.\00Cute and harmless.\00This one loves flowers.\00Added spiders.\00Weak and defenseless, but big dreams.\00Added 3 new petals.\00Added 2 new petals.\00New petals.\00A few balance tweaks.\00Buffed Iris.\00These aren't quite as nice as the little bees.\00Changed value from last change to 2.5 seconds.\00Web now affects mobs.\00Buffed Peas.\00Early levels are a bit slower.\00Unknown zone is now a lot smaller.\0aAll other zones are the same size as before, which means the map got smaller.\00A bigger rock. It doesn't do much either.\00Rare Roses now stick together.\00Rarer drops take a tiny bit longer to despawn.\00Turns out Hornets got too smart. Now only a small percentage of them will be einstein.\00Added Petal Gallery to keep track of which petals you've seen.\00It's got wings and it's ready to use them.\00Added 1 new petal.\00Added Egg petal.\00It's hungry and flowers are its favorite meal.\00Reduced Stinger health.\00Flowers now only keep up to 10 items after their death.\00A rock. It doesn't do much.\00It's just there doing its thing.\00Hornet AI is now a lot smarter. No more herding.\00Flowers now spawn at 3/4 their previous level, rather than half.\00First petal spawn when changing a slot takes at least 5 seconds.\0aWhich makes quickly swapping loadouts less effective.\00This one is really big, but still cute.\00All flowers are now the same speed, regardless of level.\0aMob chase speed adjusted to compensate.\00Battle Royale now has 3x exp and drop rate.\00Nerfed Rose.\00Petals you haven't unlocked will not appear in the title screen anymore.\00Added Cacti to medium zone.\00It's a bit temperamental, probably from working all the time.\00Mobs can now drop more than one petal at a time.\00Added Massive Beetle.\00You now get to keep some of your items and half your level when you die.\00Window is too large.\00Nerfed Hornet missile damage.\00Added Massive Centipede.\00Changed map background.\00Leaf, Cactus and Faster now only apply their effects once they have spawned the first time.\0aEffect still applies if they're reloading after they get destroyed.\00Hornets were accidentally made a lot more common a couple of days ago, that has been fixed.\00Web movement speed debuff increased.\00Cute and harmless... if left unprovoked.\00Legendary Egg hatch time nerfed.\00Improved changelog UI.\00We're back to FFA.\00Added Ladybug variant to ???.\00Changed flower health from 100-200 (lvl 1-45) to 100-150.\00This shape... it looks familiar...\00Connecting...\00This pretty little flower is called...\00Starting in %d...\00Dandelion rarity changed to Rare (now drops a lot more frequently).\00Added a little movement arrow to help find your mouse (disabled by default).\00Changed map dimensions (total area still the same, just longer sideways).\00Decreased ram damage between two low leveled flowers (to curb noobs chasing each other).\00Added keyboard controls (disabled by default until we know which players prefer).\00Rare Rose nerfed (-30% heal).\00Petal drop rates are now generated automatically.\0aThis will allow a more fair distribution of drops based on their rarity (so for example, all epics are equally as rare).\00Nerfed Leaf damage by 20%.\00default,Standard Gamepad,a:b0,b:b1,back:b8,dpdown:b13,dpleft:b14,dpright:b15,dpup:b12,guide:b16,leftshoulder:b4,leftstick:b10,lefttrigger:b6,leftx:a0,lefty:a1,rightshoulder:b5,rightstick:b11,righttrigger:b7,rightx:a2,righty:a3,start:b9,x:b2,y:b3,\00hidapi,*,a:b0,b:b1,back:b4,dpdown:b12,dpleft:b13,dpright:b14,dpup:b11,guide:b5,leftshoulder:b9,leftstick:b7,lefttrigger:a4,leftx:a0,lefty:a1,rightshoulder:b10,rightstick:b8,righttrigger:a5,rightx:a2,righty:a3,start:b6,x:b2,y:b3,\00 (timestamp=%u touchid=%lld dtheta=%f ddist=%f x=%f y=%f numfingers=%u)\00 (timestamp=%u)\00 (timestamp=%u which=%d hat=%u value=%u)\00 (timestamp=%u windowid=%u state=%s repeat=%s scancode=%u keycode=%u mod=%u)\00 (file='%s' timestamp=%u windowid=%u)\00Event queue is full (%d events)\00 (timestamp=%u windowid=%u which=%u x=%d y=%d direction=%s)\00 (timestamp=%u which=%d button=%u state=%s)\00 (timestamp=%u which=%u iscapture=%s)\00No dynamic GL support in current SDL video driver (%s)\00%s (call to %s failed, reporting an error of %s)\00%s (timestamp=%u windowid=%u code=%d data1=%p data2=%p)\00(press enter to spawn)\00(null)\00 (timestamp=%u touchid=%lld gestureid=%lld numfingers=%u error=%f x=%f y=%f)\00 (timestamp=%u touchid=%lld fingerid=%lld x=%f y=%f dx=%f dy=%f pressure=%f)\00(press enter to continue)\00(tap to continue)\00Could not create EGL context (context attributes are not supported)\00 (timestamp=%u windowid=%u which=%u button=%u state=%s clicks=%u x=%d y=%d)\00 (timestamp=%u which=%d ball=%u xrel=%d yrel=%d)\00 (timestamp=%u windowid=%u which=%u state=%u x=%d y=%d xrel=%d yrel=%d)\00 (timestamp=%u w